----- AeroDyn Driver Input File ---------------------------------------------------------
BAR turbine driver input file, using basic input
----- Input Configuration ---------------------------------------------------------------
True            Echo         - Echo input parameters to "<rootname>.ech"?
        0       MHK          - MHK turbine type (switch) {0: not an MHK turbine, 1: fixed MHK turbine, 2: floating MHK turbine}
        3       AnalysisType - {1: multiple turbines, one simulation, 2: one turbine, one time-dependent simulation, 3: one turbine, combined cases}
       20.0     TMax         - Total run time [used only when AnalysisType/=3] (s)
        0.5     DT           - Simulation time step [used only when AnalysisType/=3] (s)
"./Original_MHKF1.dat"         AeroFile - Name of the primary AeroDyn input file
----- Environmental Conditions ----------------------------------------------------------
 1.021100000000000e+03     FldDens      - Density of working fluid (kg/m^3)
 1.043000000000000e-06     KinVisc      - Kinematic viscosity of working fluid (m^2/s)
 1.500000000000000e+03     SpdSound     - Speed of sound in working fluid (m/s)
 1.013250000000000e+05     Patm         - Atmospheric pressure (Pa) [used only for an MHK turbine cavitation check]
 2.303000000000000e+03     Pvap         - Vapour pressure of working fluid (Pa) [used only for an MHK turbine cavitation check]
 3.300000000000000e+01     WtrDpth      - Water depth (m)
----- Inflow Data -----------------------------------------------------------------------
          0      CompInflow  - Compute inflow wind velocities (switch) {0=Steady Wind; 1=InflowWind}
"unused"         InflowFile  - Name of the InflowWind input file [used only when CompInflow=1]
        5.0      HWindSpeed  - Horizontal wind speed   [used only when CompInflow=0 and AnalysisType=1] (m/s)
         10      RefHt       - Reference height for horizontal wind speed [used only when CompInflow=0]  (m)
       0.00      PLExp       - Power law exponent   [used only when CompInflow=0 and AnalysisType=1]                        (-)
----- Turbine Data ----------------------------------------------------------------------
1               NumTurbines  - Number of turbines
----- Turbine(1) Geometry ---------------------------------------------------------------
        True    BasicHAWTFormat(1) - Flag to switch between basic or generic input format {True: next 7 lines are basic inputs, False: Base/Twr/Nac/Hub/Bld geometry and motion must follow}
       0,0,0    BaseOriginInit(1) - Coordinate of tower base in base coordinates (m)
           3    NumBlades(1)    - Number of blades (-)
     0.02355    HubRad(1)       - Hub radius (m)
       10.00    HubHt(1)        - Hub height (m)
           0    Overhang(1)     - Overhang (m)
           0    ShftTilt(1)     - Shaft tilt (deg)
           0    Precone(1)      - Blade precone (deg)
        0.1025  Twr2Shft(1)     - Vertical distance from the tower-top to the rotor shaft (m)
----- Turbine(1) Motion [used only when AnalysisType=1] ---------------------------------
0               BaseMotionType(1)      - Type of motion prescribed for this base {0: fixed, 1: Sinusoidal motion, 2: arbitrary motion} (flag)
1               DegreeOfFreedom(1)     - {1:xg, 2:yg, 3:zg, 4:theta_xg, 5:theta_yg, 6:theta_zg} [used only when BaseMotionType=1] (flag)
5.0             Amplitude(1)           - Amplitude of sinusoidal motion   [used only when BaseMotionType=1]
0.1             Frequency(1)           - Frequency of sinusoidal motion   [used only when BaseMotionType=1]
""              BaseMotionFileName(1)  - Filename containing arbitrary base motion (19 columns: Time, x, y, z, theta_x, ..., alpha_z)  [used only when BaseMotionType=2]
0               NacYaw(1)              - Yaw angle (about z_t) of the nacelle (deg)
105             RotSpeed(1)            - Rotational speed of rotor in rotor coordinates (rpm)
0               BldPitch(1)            - Blade 1 pitch (deg)
----- Time-dependent Analysis [used only when AnalysisType=2, numTurbines=1] ------------
"unused"         TimeAnalysisFileName - Filename containing time series (6 column: Time, HWndSpeed, PLExp, RotSpd, Pitch, Yaw). 
----- Combined-Case Analysis [used only when AnalysisType=3, numTurbines=1] -------------
        264  NumCases     - Number of cases to run
